              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SPARKLE33"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Tasty! I like that it tastes unique and not exactly like any other dressing. I used only 1/3 cup mayo and and still find it a tad too mayo-ey. \n\nNext time I'll try to half this recipe, as we'll never eat 3 cups of dressing. :)",
            "datePublished": "2008-12-29T17:08:54.223Z"
          },
          {
