            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "eating good in AZ"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Had to make a few changes, since there are only 2 of us. I replaced the soup with about 1/4 Cup of kethcup, since I didn't want a open can of soup. I used sour cream instead of mayo and added more hot sauce. It was really good and we thought it would make a great condiment for french fries or even on a burger.",
            "datePublished": "2006-05-07T18:34:50.607Z"
